Start
- 3 tokens
- Each Player Has 20 HP
Buy Phase
- 3 Cards, Choose which to buy
- 1 token to reroll
Placing Phase
- 3 by 3 grid
- Move cards from hand onto board
- Cannot see opponent placing because of divider till fight
Fighting Phase
- Attack in front if front row is blank attacks player health
- Healers heal  before fight starts ( 1 overheal allowed)

Win Codition
- If your opponent dies you win

All dead bees go to the bottom of the shop deck on kill

Classes:
-Tanks do 1 less attack than attack bees (Attack does not upgrade, but the bees shield gets refilled and has 1 added to it) Cost:3
HP:3 + 2 Def
Amount in deck : 10
-Magic attacks 2 squares infront of them but upgraded can go three (2 at start upgraded 4) Cost:2
HP:1
Amount in deck : 3
-attack bees do most damage (2 at start upgraded 3) Cost:1
HP:2
Amount in deck : 12
-Healer bees heal 1 square in front of them, upgraded can heal 1 and 2 squares infront (Attack stat is switched to how much they heal AND they heal every square said on the card) Cost:2
HP:1
Amount in deck : 5

Attack stat is in top left, cost is top right, and HP / sheild is bottom right
